#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0323 expect=skipped domain=ADSL
#note "The literal name ADSL detects SUBJECT LEVEL ANALYSIS DATASET, which is NOT one of the four Include tokens and has no supertype path to any of them, so the scenario pre-gate refuses execution. APHASEN IS present, so Requirements.Variables is satisfied and the structure is the only possible reason for the skip. Pins the deliberate absence of ADSL from the sheet's Domains list."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADSL
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col APHASE  type=Char
col APHASEN type=Num
---
S1 | 001 | TREATMENT | 2
S1 | 002 | TREATMENT | 2
S1 | 003 | TREATMENT | 3
